sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Candidate
  participant N as n8n (IMAP / webhook)
  participant IG as Injection Guard
  participant WF as Workflow (orchestration/)
  participant AG as AI Agent (Gemini | Grok)
  participant OV as Output Validator
  participant DB as Database
  participant UI as Recruiter UI (Streamlit)
  participant EX as Action Executor

  C->>N: Email + resume PDF (may hide payload)
  N->>IG: POST /webhooks/email (HMAC + timestamp)
  IG->>IG: Magic bytes, strip hidden text, sanitize, scan
  alt high-risk payload
    IG->>DB: quarantine + SecurityEvent + audit
    IG-->>UI: AI Firewall lights up (events / WS)
  else clean or low risk
    IG->>WF: sanitized content
    WF->>AG: classify + draft (no tools, JSON only, untrusted text fenced)
    AG->>OV: DraftReply JSON (Pydantic-validated)
    OV->>DB: ProposedAction(status=PENDING, risk flags)
    Note over WF: workflow pauses (interrupt)
    UI->>DB: fetch pending queue
    UI->>EX: approve(action_id, edits) + recruiter JWT
    EX->>EX: role + status==PENDING, sign Approval(payload_hash)
    EX->>EX: verify signature + payload hash
    EX->>C: send email (MailHog in demo, outbox otherwise)
    EX->>DB: SentEmail + hash-chained audit entry
    EX->>WF: resume hook (mark email handled)
  end
